1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:52,720 --> 00:01:54,600
This place is heaven for a devil like me.

25
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:57,080
That fiend definitely can’t get in.

26
00:01:57,560 --> 00:02:00,640
Once I turn all these fools into my underlings,

27
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:02,240
I’ll strike back

28
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:03,600
and kill that fiend !

29
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:06,280
You ate my stuff

30
00:02:06,880 --> 00:02:08,640
so from now on we’re brothers, right ?

31
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:11,240
You’ve gotta listen to me, understand ?

32
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:16,080
No ! Don’t fight over it !

33
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:20,840
You’re all my underlings now !

34
00:02:21,920 --> 00:02:23,080
Respect me !

35
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:24,160
Go !

36
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:31,080
As I thought...

37
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:33,640
Even if I have a physical body,

38
00:02:33,640 --> 00:02:36,440
I'm also a Soul Devourer when I'm in this Nirvana Space.

39
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:40,080
I can still devour and command wandering souls.

40
00:02:40,720 --> 00:02:42,240
How can this be ?

41
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:43,400
My underlings !

42
00:02:43,400 --> 00:02:45,200
My great ambitions !

43
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:48,800
The fiend is too terrifying...

44
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:56,640
Master, I knew you wanted to devour them

45
00:02:56,760 --> 00:02:59,200
so I scattered some bait to lure them over.

46
00:03:06,440 --> 00:03:08,560
There are many wandering souls in the trial

47
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:10,160
but no Soul Devourers.

48
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:13,520
That means no one can stop me in the third trial.

49
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:21,480
Find the Soul Formation cultivators that entered here.

50
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:24,000
I want them alive.

51
00:03:33,200 --> 00:03:34,720
You’re pushing me too far...

52
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,760
Heaven-Slaying Demon Palm !

53
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:44,560
If it weren't for that brat causing my cultivation to plummet,

54
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:47,560
how could I have fallen to such a state ?

55
00:04:06,720 --> 00:04:09,120
Now I'm even forced to use the Heaven Sealing Pagoda...

56
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:12,600
Do the heavens want me dead ?

57
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:20,520
Found him.

58
00:04:26,320 --> 00:04:28,880
Hand over the inheritance treasure.

59
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:35,400
Senior,

60
00:04:36,280 --> 00:04:39,440
I don’t know what inheritance treasure you are talking about.

61
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:41,720
Without the inheritance treasure,

62
00:04:42,320 --> 00:04:44,400
how did you enter

63
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:46,760
and how will you leave ?

64
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:51,160
With a set of hand seals.

65
00:04:51,640 --> 00:04:53,520
When Junior last came here,

66
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:56,360
I found and memorized a set of hand seals.

67
00:04:57,200 --> 00:04:58,200
This set of hand seals

68
00:04:58,520 --> 00:05:01,760
can only be used next to the gate that the end of a trial.

69
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:05,040
Could you take me to that gate ?

70
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:08,640
I’ll give you the set of hand seals.

71
00:05:10,880 --> 00:05:13,760
If you kill me, you’ll never get it !

72
00:05:16,440 --> 00:05:17,280
It’s you !

73
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:26,800
Brat, what the hell did you find in the Land of the Ancient God

74
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:28,680
that turned you into this ?

75
00:05:43,280 --> 00:05:45,080
Little friend, let’s talk !

76
00:05:45,080 --> 00:05:46,880
We can leave together !

77
00:05:49,840 --> 00:05:51,600
I'll give it to you !

78
00:06:05,280 --> 00:06:06,040
Hunchback Meng ?

79
00:06:08,760 --> 00:06:10,040
He actually didn’t die ?

80
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:12,000
Master said

81
00:06:12,440 --> 00:06:15,480
that no one is allowed to live through the third trial !

82
00:06:32,080 --> 00:06:33,920
Hunchback Meng actually came back from the dead.

83
00:06:34,080 --> 00:06:35,960
This Land of the Ancient God is too weird.

84
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:45,640
The wandering souls’ attacks are useless...

85
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:01,600
Divine Sense,

86
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:02,880
explode !

87
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:16,400
Even my Divine Sense attack was useless...

88
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:17,920
Something's wrong with him.

89
00:07:18,640 --> 00:07:20,920
I have no idea what that thing is

90
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:23,640
but it's even more terrifying than before.

91
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:25,640
It looks like he doesn't have a Divine Sense,

92
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:27,600
he’s no longer human !

93
00:07:28,280 --> 00:07:30,600
Master, what should we do ?

94
00:07:36,440 --> 00:07:37,880
Hunchback Meng killed Duanmu Ji.

95
00:07:38,200 --> 00:07:41,040
It seems he wants to kill all the intruders in the third trial.

96
00:07:41,080 --> 00:07:42,640
I cannot rely on Divine Sense attacks.

97
00:07:42,880 --> 00:07:45,520
With my Core Formation cultivation, I have no chance.

98
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:48,680
It looks like I'll need to divert him with something else.

99
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:04,600
Anger !

100
00:08:09,400 --> 00:08:10,800
My cultivation has fallen.

101
00:08:11,200 --> 00:08:13,960
I need to completely rely on you for this third trial.

102
00:08:17,080 --> 00:08:17,880
Return.

103
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:20,360
Very good,

104
00:08:20,840 --> 00:08:24,800
I didn't waste 1000 years refining you into a puppet.

105
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:28,520
Cunning brat,

106
00:08:28,840 --> 00:08:30,600
you dare to show yourself before me ?

107
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:32,760
Kill him ! Kill him now !

108
00:08:37,160 --> 00:08:39,120
You can control the wandering souls !?

109
00:08:40,840 --> 00:08:41,640
Anger !

110
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:47,200
You damn brat,

111
00:08:47,560 --> 00:08:49,240
what the hell did you do ?

112
00:08:50,720 --> 00:08:52,120
Once I catch you,

113
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:54,360
I’ll cast you into the hell of desires

114
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:55,440
never to be reborn !

115
00:08:56,400 --> 00:08:57,720
Thank you, Senior.

116
00:09:06,240 --> 00:09:08,000
There's another one !

117
00:09:08,800 --> 00:09:10,600
That’s wonderful !

118
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:13,280
Hunchback Meng, why are you looking like a ghost ?

119
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:14,720
Master said

120
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:18,760
that I'll be rewarded for killing people in the third trial.

121
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:20,640
His Divine Sense is gone.

122
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:23,120
The old hunchback was refined into a high-level puppet.

123
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,800
You're in the way !

124
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:28,080
This cultivation...

125
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:30,480
You... you’re already Late stage Soul Formation ?

126
00:09:38,520 --> 00:09:40,040
Desire Blood Escape Technique ?

127
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:41,760
Useless !

128
00:09:46,560 --> 00:09:48,120
Six Desires, activate !

129
00:09:50,400 --> 00:09:52,000
This Turtle Bone Puppet

130
00:09:52,680 --> 00:09:53,720
is too weak !

131
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:56,040
How is this possible ?

132
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:57,000
How is this possible !?

133
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:58,200
Who the hell are you !?

134
00:10:04,400 --> 00:10:06,200
Who dares to harm my disciple ?

135
00:10:14,680 --> 00:10:16,840
Sky Devil Magician\NXuan Tian Sect Ancestor\NLate stage Soul Formation

136
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:18,480
Master !

137
00:10:19,160 --> 00:10:21,720
Yi’er, do you still recognize me ?

138
00:10:22,280 --> 00:10:23,120
Very good.

139
00:10:23,920 --> 00:10:26,160
Master, it’s been 1000 years !

140
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:27,520
You’re still alive !

141
00:10:27,800 --> 00:10:28,960
You’re really still alive !

142
00:10:29,680 --> 00:10:33,720
How dare you defy Master’s orders ?

143
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:37,840
An insect that couldn't retain his consciousness

144
00:10:38,040 --> 00:10:40,320
dares to lecture me ?

145
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:47,640
For harming Yi'er,

146
00:10:47,680 --> 00:10:49,920
you deserve to die by a thousand cuts.

147
00:10:50,520 --> 00:10:53,000
But you're already dead, it's all the same.

148
00:11:08,920 --> 00:11:10,440
As Duanmu Ji said,

149
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:14,120
this set of hand seals can only be used at the gate.

150
00:11:46,200 --> 00:11:47,080
This is bad !

151
00:11:47,280 --> 00:11:48,520
The hand seals failed.

152
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:53,600
You are...

153
00:11:54,400 --> 00:11:55,680
a Soul Devourer ?

154
00:11:56,600 --> 00:11:57,800
Good.

155
00:12:16,800 --> 00:12:19,880
Tuo Sen\NTu Si's demon\N8-stars Ancient God

156
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:46,920
My Demon Puppets,

157
00:12:48,280 --> 00:12:50,080
capture this Soul Devourer.

158
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:52,600
Bring him here.

159
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:14,400
Weird... Where did that Soul Devourer go ?

160
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:20,400
Soul Devourer ?

161
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:22,680
These people are here to capture me.

162
00:13:23,000 --> 00:13:24,080
Could it be...

163
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:26,000
What are you doing here ?

164
00:13:28,760 --> 00:13:31,080
we are obeying Master's orders

165
00:13:31,280 --> 00:13:33,400
to capture that Soul Devourer.

166
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:35,080
Did you get him ?

167
00:13:38,160 --> 00:13:39,520
What are you standing there for ?

168
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:41,760
Who will take responsibility

169
00:13:41,800 --> 00:13:43,280
if it takes too long ?

170
00:13:45,840 --> 00:13:46,760
Master ?

171
00:13:47,680 --> 00:13:50,080
Didn’t the Ancient God die long ago ?

172
00:13:50,360 --> 00:13:51,640
Who is this Master ?

173
00:13:52,640 --> 00:13:55,000
Everyone’s gone, come out.

174
00:13:57,920 --> 00:14:01,080
Master, what’s going on ?

175
00:14:03,680 --> 00:14:05,960
Six Desires Devil Lord’s Master isn’t dead either ?

176
00:14:06,160 --> 00:14:10,520
Actually, there's no treasure to find in the Land of the Ancient God.

177
00:14:11,160 --> 00:14:13,320
It’s been a trap from the very beginning.

178
00:14:13,560 --> 00:14:15,280
What... what does this mean ?

179
00:14:15,960 --> 00:14:17,320
After I died,

180
00:14:17,920 --> 00:14:20,000
I woke up in the Blood Sea

181
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:21,680
and came back from the dead

182
00:14:21,680 --> 00:14:23,080
with this appearance.

183
00:14:23,800 --> 00:14:25,000
Only then

184
00:14:25,200 --> 00:14:28,280
did I learn the truth of the Land of the Ancient God.

185
00:14:29,920 --> 00:14:31,120
Long ago

186
00:14:31,320 --> 00:14:33,440
A cultivator named Tuo Sen

187
00:14:33,640 --> 00:14:36,080
fought a great battle against Ancient God Tu Si

188
00:14:36,320 --> 00:14:38,040
to obtain his inheritance.

189
00:14:38,600 --> 00:14:41,160
Using his last remaining strength,

190
00:14:41,400 --> 00:14:45,280
Tu Si sealed Tuo Sen in the Blood Sea inside his Sea of Consciousness.

191
00:14:49,280 --> 00:14:51,280
Tuo Sen was not willing to accept this

192
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:53,640
so he set a trap in the Land of the Ancient God

193
00:14:53,640 --> 00:14:55,480
and spread rumors

194
00:14:55,800 --> 00:14:57,880
to attract countless cultivators.

195
00:14:58,680 --> 00:15:00,880
Anyone who dies in the Land of the Ancient God

196
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:03,120
will be reborn in the Blood Sea

197
00:15:03,520 --> 00:15:05,040
and become his puppet.

198
00:15:06,320 --> 00:15:08,120
The reason he's doing this

199
00:15:08,120 --> 00:15:11,960
is to slowly expel the seal out of his body

200
00:15:12,480 --> 00:15:14,040
and transfer it to others.

201
00:15:14,760 --> 00:15:16,840
He is waiting for the day the seal loosens

202
00:15:16,840 --> 00:15:17,920
to break free

203
00:15:19,120 --> 00:15:20,520
and regain his freedom.

204
00:15:25,280 --> 00:15:29,360
You didn’t die so you could've used the hand seals to escape.

205
00:15:30,280 --> 00:15:33,520
But now, Tuo Sen has completely sealed the Land of the Ancient God.

206
00:15:34,480 --> 00:15:37,680
To leave, you'll need to gamble.

207
00:15:39,040 --> 00:15:40,280
Don’t be afraid my disciple,

208
00:15:40,320 --> 00:15:41,120
Master is here.

209
00:15:41,880 --> 00:15:43,880
Even if I have to risk my life,

210
00:15:44,400 --> 00:15:46,680
I will definitely get you out of here.

211
00:15:47,560 --> 00:15:48,360
Master...

212
00:15:49,120 --> 00:15:50,400
Stay close to me.

213
00:16:12,080 --> 00:16:13,560
With blood as the guide

214
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:15,760
and veins as the source.

215
00:16:16,760 --> 00:16:17,560
Break !

216
00:16:26,960 --> 00:16:28,280
This overwhelming desire...

217
00:16:29,640 --> 00:16:30,920
What a sinister technique !

218
00:16:32,200 --> 00:16:33,000
Follow me.

219
00:17:25,210 --> 00:17:32,090
Count the specks of time

220
00:17:29,090 --> 00:17:32,090
floating down gently.

221
00:17:32,450 --> 00:17:38,330
The carving knife in your hands etches out destiny.

222
00:17:39,450 --> 00:17:45,850
Forever lock away the scars

223
00:17:43,250 --> 00:17:45,850
of this mortal life.

224
00:17:46,110 --> 00:17:52,370
This fleeting youth is a thing of the past.

225
00:17:53,010 --> 00:18:00,090
The flying bird could not escape the twilight

226
00:17:55,690 --> 00:18:00,090
that fills the sky with a myriad of colors.

227
00:18:00,170 --> 00:18:07,250
The night-blooming flower cannot drink

228
00:18:02,210 --> 00:18:07,250
the crystalization of the golden wind and the jade dew.

229
00:18:07,690 --> 00:18:09,770
I will ask the heavens who exactly

230
00:18:09,770 --> 00:18:14,530
sliced open this world

231
00:18:11,170 --> 00:18:14,530
to let the rain fall in.

232
00:18:14,530 --> 00:18:16,530
I will refine the world

233
00:18:16,610 --> 00:18:19,050
to make our palm lines say

234
00:18:19,250 --> 00:18:21,410
that we will live forever.

235
00:18:21,410 --> 00:18:24,330
Walking off the beaten path

236
00:18:24,330 --> 00:18:27,410
through heaven and earth.

237
00:18:28,690 --> 00:18:34,370
Before returning to dust,

238
00:18:30,610 --> 00:18:34,370
I will refine this mortal body.

239
00:18:35,890 --> 00:18:43,250
The left shore is the joyous laughter

240
00:18:39,770 --> 00:18:43,250
that can brighten up a thousand years of sadness.

241
00:18:43,250 --> 00:18:49,850
The right shore is an eternal silence

242
00:18:44,850 --> 00:18:49,850
lingering under the candlelight.

243
00:18:50,050 --> 00:18:52,730
To overturn this fate,

244
00:18:52,730 --> 00:18:57,090
I will walk against the heavens.

245
00:18:57,530 --> 00:19:04,250
I will even gather the clouds

246
00:19:00,050 --> 00:19:04,250
to illuminate the sky for you.

247
00:19:04,650 --> 00:19:08,490
All this sadness was not meaningless.

248
00:19:08,490 --> 00:19:11,810
How many lives and deaths\Nhave passed in the blink of an eye ?

249
00:19:11,810 --> 00:19:17,610
I vow to break

250
00:19:14,050 --> 00:19:17,610
this chess game of fate.

251
00:19:18,930 --> 00:19:28,570
I vow to break

252
00:19:20,730 --> 00:19:28,570
this chess game of fate.
